    {
      "id": "project-notes",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Repo Landing Surface",
      "position": {
        "x": 520,
        "y": -360
      },
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "content.root"
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "project-class",
          "nodeId": "repo"
        },
        "markdown": "A repo is a library kept in a repository. It is a collection of shelves: each shelf is a graph the repo contains through a portal and a `contains` edge from its `members` port, and the graph behind a portal is read live. It also says where the library lives: the owner, the repository and the branch, whether it is read from GitHub through the app or from a site, and whether it is published.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Project\n\nA project is more than a plan: a plan says how something gets done, and a project says why it exists, how it is going, and keeps everything gathered around it. It is a **Collection**: its members are its **shelves**, each a portal the Project contains (a `contains` edge from its `members` port), and the graphs behind them are read live. It adds the facts about itself: what it is for, its status (idea, active, paused or done), where it stands now, who leads it and where it lives.\n\nA shelf is a Collection of its own. The Project template derives the project’s Detail, Summary and Glyph from these."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
